  "question": {
    "text": "Green light of wavelength $5460 Å$ is incident on an airglass interface. If the refractive index of glass is $1.5$, the wavelength of light in glass would be $\\left(\\mathrm{c}=3 \\times 10^{8} \\mathrm{~ms}^{-1}\\right)$",
    "image": null
  },
